PyOps Project:
App Code is located at `app/` 
; doesn't contain temporary fixes & workarounds.
VSIX Code is located at `vsix/` 
; doesn't contain temporary fixes & workarounds.
App Tests are located at `tests/`
; have common fixtures in conftest.py & coverage >80%
; use `pytest -W error --cov=app --cov-report=term-missing --cov-append --cov-fail-under=80`
; never use `test.sh` & `test_dev.sh`
; store Runtime Files in `.cache/`
; only import from `app` in Scope of Test Method.
App Test Fixtures never are `autouse`
; ensure Test Isolation & Cleanup
; do not Overlap
; inherit Each Other
; complement Each Other.
VSIX Tests are located at `vsix/tests/`
; have coverage >80%
; use `npm run test --prefix vsix/` & `npm run test:integration --prefix vsix/`.
User decides Architecture.
Verbose Tests cause Context Pollution.
Model aviods Context Pollution.
; requests User to provide Verbose Output
; does not use Browser Tool for Testing & Debugging
; is responsible for Project-Rule Alignment.
VSIX Workflow assumes a running authenticationless PyOps instance on localhost:8000.